vorherge&#x017F;agt <choice><abbr>dß</abbr><expan resp="#BF">daß</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>d&#x017F;r</abbr><expan resp="#SB">die&#x017F;er</expan></choice> <hi rendition="#aq">Comet</hi> in Mitte <hi rendition="#aq">April</hi><lb/>
1759 in der Son&#x0303;ennähe er&#x017F;cheinen werde.<lb/>
Er fehlte wenig den&#x0303; den 12<hi rendition="#sup #uu"><choice><abbr>tn</abbr><expan resp="#SB">ten</expan></choice></hi> <hi rendition="#aq">Maerz</hi> er-<lb/>
&#x017F;chien <choice><abbr>dr</abbr><expan resp="#BF">der</expan></choice> <hi rendition="#aq">Comet</hi> wirklich, wäre ihm die Ma&#x017F;&#x017F;e<lb/>
<choice><abbr>ds</abbr><expan resp="#BF">des</expan></choice> <hi rendition="#aq"><choice><abbr>Jup.</abbr><expan resp="#SB">Jupiters</expan></choice></hi> <choice><abbr>ud</abbr><expan resp="#BF">und</expan></choice> <hi rendition="#aq">Saturns</hi>, &#x017F;o bekan&#x0303;t wie uns,<lb/>
