<p><note place="left">Das Leuchten <choice><abbr>ds</abbr><expan resp="#SB">des</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>W&#x017F;&#x017F;rs</abbr><expan resp="#SB">Wa&#x017F;&#x017F;ers</expan></choice><lb/>
</note>In manchen Gegenden <add place="superlinear"><metamark/>unter den <hi rendition="#aq">Tropen</hi> </add><choice><abbr>ud</abbr><expan resp="#SB">und</expan></choice> bei gewi&#x017F;&#x017F;en<lb/>
