</note>Unter den Ureinwohner <choice><abbr>v</abbr><expan resp="#SB">von</expan></choice> <hi rendition="#aq">America</hi> i&#x017F;t<lb/>
<choice><abbr>Unter&#x017F;chd:</abbr><expan resp="#SB">Unter&#x017F;chied</expan></choice> in Farbe nicht groß. Die<lb/>
<choice><abbr>nördl</abbr><expan resp="#SB">nördlichen</expan></choice> <hi rendition="#aq">Mexicaner</hi> &#x017F;ind &#x017F;ehr <hi rendition="#aq">bronett</hi> <choice><abbr>ud</abbr><expan resp="#SB">und</expan></choice> <hi rendition="#aq">bärtig</hi><lb/>
jen&#x017F;eit <choice><abbr>dr</abbr><expan resp="#SB">der</expan></choice> <hi rendition="#aq">Tropen</hi>, <choice><abbr>ud</abbr><expan resp="#SB">und</expan></choice> in den Ebenen giebt<lb/>
<pb facs="#f0300" n="433"/>
es weiße Men&#x017F;chenracen, wohnen<lb/>
